{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Who we are</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are an indie studio formed by two video game enthusiasts, all feedback is welcome to help us improve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hand-drawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every animation is hand-drawn using the &quot;rubber hose&quot; technique, for a total immersion in the golden age of animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/amano.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this wacky world, hunger and thirst are just the beginning! Troublesome little creatures and unexpected dangers will keep you on your toes. You'll have to rely on your ingenuity in crafting to make what you need and get by.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/pesca.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land and sea depths await you! Venture through bizarre lands, dig in pitch-black mines (miner's hat on!), or dive into the abyss with self-built masks or mini-subs to unveil the secrets of ancient submerged wrecks.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/batiscafo.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect the creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The bizarre creatures of this world can become your allies! Tame them to help you in exploration and survival. With the right care, you'll see them evolve into even more extravagant and powerful forms!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/evoluzione.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From your custom base, with defenses and workbenches, to incredible vehicles! Assemble mechs to roam the mainland, flying machines to rule the skies, or submarines<strong>\u00a0</strong>for underwater exploration. All with a retro touch!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/craft.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gather resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An axe with eyes? Sure! Chop down trees for building wood, extract precious minerals, and grow bizarre vegetables to never go hungry.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/ascia_c.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all creatures are friendly, and gigantic bosses await you! Craft vintage-flavored weapons, including guns that look like they're straight out of an old cartoon, and prepare for... well, explosive encounters!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/boss.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant quirky seeds and tend to your animated saplings. A bountiful harvest is the key to never going hungry and having energy for new adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/semina.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The underground calls! Arm yourself with your trusty pickaxe and break rocks to extract stones, shiny metals, and other essential resources. Every strike brings you closer to new creations and upgrades for your base and gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/piccone.gif?t=1749238821\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789230?t=1749238821","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789230?t=1749238821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/fb44c101c62394d08d60a40b08c8a4b2c1355d1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749238821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/fb44c101c62394d08d60a40b08c8a4b2c1355d1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749238821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Who we are</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are an indie studio formed by two video game enthusiasts, all feedback is welcome to help us improve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hand-drawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every animation is hand-drawn using the &quot;rubber hose&quot; technique, for a total immersion in the golden age of animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/37892